SUMMARY:A/B Joint Ride - BierHall Conestoga Cruisin Ride (57F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nAnticipated average pace:
  **17-19 mph**\n\n**This is a combined A and B level ride. Group will stay
  together and no one will be dropped. Ride will start and end at BierHall 
 Brewery. We will ride from BierHall and start the ride cue from Conestoga 
 High School. We will complete the cue and ride back to BierHall. After the
  ride\, celebrate with some beverages and food with your fellow cyclists a
 t the [BierBrewery Brewery Outdoor BierGarden](https://www.bierhallbrewing
 .com/)**\n\nCue and GPX link: https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30114828\n\nH
 elmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair ki
 t (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing 
 around a pen and paper waiver\, we require an LBC Club membership and Meet
 up RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are 
 a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?
 page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the
  club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.asp
 x?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\,\n\n[Rules of the Road](htt
 ps://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&m
 odule_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.as
 hx?id=454318)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3163741
